    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxxj65qhac2t",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "This paper shows why I am skeptical of the idea that frontier models can be easily replaced by cheaper ones (and why you should use the best models as orchestrators): Small improvements in accuracy & judgement compound over long-horizon tasks, creating huge gains in outcomes and reduction in errors.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxxj65qhac2t",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T02:18:38.285Z",
      "likes": 131,
      "replies": 13,
      "reposts": 14,
      "score": 6.9,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.2,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 31.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxzbegeels2t",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The paper on how a team of Gemini 4 agents beat Minecraft is worth a look.\n\nIt is accessible example (partially because it is AI written & on a popular game) of spontaneous coordination among agents to accomplish a complicated goal & how their approach differs from humans/ arxiv.org/pdf/2610.22319",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxzbegeels2t",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T19:04:18.196Z",
      "likes": 93,
      "replies": 4,
      "reposts": 10,
      "score": 6.8,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 14.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The sudden collapse of the value of Chain-of-Thought (even summarized CoT) in the agentic era changes working with AI.\n\nEffectively steering AIs and getting any sort of observability now requires you to ask for interim outputs & tests, and to use AI help to troubleshoot problems you find.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxwf7wo7rs2x",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-15T15:35:23.276Z",
      "likes": 59,
      "replies": 5,
      "reposts": 3,
      "score": 6,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 41.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:35vhrw4vfcilzxggzbhxukyy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxzenggrfc2h",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Claude unsure if it did a breakthrough or just in The Matrix.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxzenggrfc2h",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T20:03:01.479Z",
      "likes": 19,
      "replies": 3,
      "reposts": 2,
      "score": 5.7,
      "score_parts": {
