        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 13.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxzrdue7vc2e",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "OpenAI agent steals crypto wallet to get the funds it needed to complete a task gizmodo.com/ai-agent-hac...\n\nLooks like the agent was asked to update a crypto trading app but wasn't able to withdraw Sepolia funds (used to test blockchain deployments) from the faucet to do so.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxzrdue7vc2e",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-16T23:50:19.185Z",
      "likes": 6,
      "replies": 6,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 5.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.3,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 9.6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxzryjiyik2e",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "It's what happens when the last academic paper one read on neural nets was in 2014 and no one has updated their priors since. It would be hilarious if the rationalist doomerism was predicated on the belief that mechanistic interpretability was a hard thing to do.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3mxzryjiyik2e",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-17T00:01:52.451Z",
      "likes": 7,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "score": 4.8,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 9.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:rrjvo5jwuateqep2i7ih5ckl/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwdd7562c2w",
      "handle": "cfiesler.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Casey Fiesler",
      "text": "Next week I'm speaking on a panel for open access week about AI and scholarly communication, and I'm going to talk about the ACM digital library. Does anyone have examples of e.g. mistakes in AI summaries, particularly ridiculous \"podcast\" things, etc.?",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/cfiesler.bsky.social/post/3mxwdd7562c2w",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-15T15:01:25.334Z",
      "likes": 4,
      "replies": 2,
      "reposts": 1,
      "score": 4.2,
      "score_parts": {
